// Two stable equilibria: (X,Y) = (1,1) and (3,3).
// The intermediate equilibrium (2,2) is unstable.
directive synthesis {mode=multistability;solver=nlsat;timeout=10;seed=7}
directive simulation {final=20;points=100;plots=[X;Y]}
| 0.5 X | 0.5 Y
| ->{6} X
| X ->{11}
| X + X ->{6} 3X
| 3X ->{1} 2X
| X ->{1} X + Y
| Y ->{1}
